I am finished with my work for today.
I pack my bag.
I say goodbye to Peter at the office.
I walk out of the office building.
I stop on the street and look at the sky.
I am very surprised.
It is only afternoon.
But it is already completely dark.
The streetlights are on everywhere.
It gets dark very early in the winter.
It is very different from Mexico.
The wind is still blowing hard.
It quickly gets colder now.
I pull my thick scarf up.
I walk down the street in the fading light.
I walk towards the bus stop.
I wait for the bus in the dark.
